helix-shell (1.0-7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Fix the QML import path: debian/install puts the module at
    /usr/share/helix-shell/, so the runner must addImportPath(BASE)
    and load BASE/HelixShellContent/Shell.qml. The old BASE/qml path
    matched nothing — the shell never loaded, leaving bare labwc.

